[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0010","text":"时间还来得及\n训练前先稍微放松一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0020","text":"朝日，想吃什么？\n想点什么就点什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0030","text":"……什么都行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0040","text":"是吗……那我决定了哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0050","text":"……蛋糕和芭菲"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0060","text":"……想好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0070","text":"……抱歉，很难吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0080","text":"朝日，你已经不想再站上舞台了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0090","text":"……不是那样的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0100","text":"也是呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0110","text":"────对不起\n说不出来的话……现在先别想了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0120","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0130","text":"现在不用急着找答案"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0140","text":"────朝日，只要别忘记那份“想做”的心情就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0150","text":"“想做”的心情……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0160","text":"嗯\n所以，先好好吃饭吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0170","text":"从今天的训练开始，一步一步来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02170000_03_0180","text":"────好的！"}]
